   "version": "v0.4.16",
   "title": "Q6: replication analysis script",
   "date": "2026-11-22",
   "html": "<p>### Q6: replication analysis (tooling for Phase 2b)</p><p><strong>What</strong>: <code>experiments/checks/replication_analysis.py</code> (stdlib + numpy; written by a subagent, reviewed and self-tested by the main agent). It applies the <strong>already-committed</strong> Phase 2b criteria from <code>experiments/checks/PREDICTIONS.md</code> and the registry to run folders: C5 (E1 beats E10: VERIFIED / PARTIAL / REFUTED), seed noise, old-E1 reproducibility, E0 parity, the loop question (E9 vs E2, threshold 2√2·s_E1), E11 (free / helps / hurts), and the E10 prediction scorecard. No new prediction: it only mechanises criteria registered in v0.4.11 and v0.4.13.</p><p><strong>Run selection</strong>: status done, <code>max_tokens</code> = 200M (drops K7's 20M sweep runs), LR equal to the K7-tuned LR (read from <code>results/K7.json</code>), code not dirty, latest run per (experiment, seed). Any verdict with missing runs is INCOMPLETE and lists what's missing. Nothing is computed on partial data.</p><p><strong>Results</strong>: <code>--selftest</code> PASS: every verdict branch is exercised on synthetic run folders through the real discovery and filter code, including five excluded run types. On real data (<code>--no-save</code>) every verdict is INCOMPLETE, as expected: K7 isn't finished and Phase 2b hasn't run.</p><p><strong>Caveats</strong>: per-step train-loss jumps (E10 prediction item 5) can't be checked from <code>summary.json</code>, so they're reported NOT_CHECKED. The repo save path (<code>common.save</code>) is untested until the first real run.</p><p>### K7 (in progress): campaign interrupted after item 1/8 Item 1 finished: E10, lr 1e-3, 20M tokens → val 1.2385, bpc 0.4802, 1.86 min. Item 2's preflight then <strong>refused</strong>, because a subagent had created an untracked file under <code>tools/</code> (the 3D page's <code>tools/viz/export_arch.py</code>), and the campaign aborted by design (code paths must be committed). No result was affected. Items 2–8 will relaunch once that work is committed. Lesson: subagent briefs must not create files under code paths while a campaign runs.</p><p><strong>Queue</strong>: Q3 done (K8 <code>--plan</code> resolved the snapshot), Q6 done.</p>"
